*.pyc
.DS_Store

# Per-machine assistant tooling (instructions, settings, state); never commit.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.md
AGENTS.override.md
codex.md
.codex/
GEMINI.md
