.a5c/

# Kernel-API (KAPI) debug logs — can be enormous (14.7 GB observed) and exceed Git LFS limits.
# Never commit them; they are instrumentation side-effects, not analysis artifacts.
**/*_kapi_*.log

# Raw run outputs (per-request bench JSON, server logs, profiler dumps) stay out of git;
# commit summaries instead. Replaces the per-directory raw/.gitignore stubs.
**/raw/
